From a82c2487a800d829cbc895d13ac9277c10524caa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 11:07:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make uploaded photos/videos view-only for dealers; add Fanman
 hero to apply screen
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dealer-facing fix: once a photo or video is uploaded on the /dealer/apply
screen, the tile becomes view-only (tap opens it full-size) instead of
silently reopening the camera and overwriting the capture. Only an admin
can now unlock a re-upload, via the new Clear button on each MediaTile in
AdminDealers.jsx's Photos & Media and Identity Documents sections.

Visual: replaced the plain topbar on /dealer/apply with the same
Fanman-mascot bounce + cape-flow hero banner Store.jsx already uses for
real dealers, for visual consistency with the rest of the live app (no
new font dependency introduced — none exists elsewhere in the app).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GxWPdEf21EL6SvRpGBbX8q
